      "notes": "No-auth public release surface only. The keyed /api/v1 service is forbidden for V6. Generic acquisition intentionally fetches only the small release manifest/contract page; large CSV/DuckDB assets remain outside the 1 MB generic HTTP path until a bounded streaming identity adapter is implemented."
